            "text_position": "place-self-center text-center",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "subheading": "Our Story",
            "title": "The brand we always meant to build",
            "content": "<p>Go-To Gifting was founded on a bigger idea than any one brand. Back in 2014, a group of MBA classmates set out to build a whole family of gifting brands — thoughtful, memorable gifts for every kind of person and occasion. The first one out of the gate was The BroBasket: “If women get flowers, what do men get? How about a bucket of beer.” It worked. It worked so well, in fact, that running it consumed everything. The other brands we always dreamed of building stayed on the whiteboard for years.</p><p>Now, with James at the helm, we’re finally doing what we set out to do from day one — launching the brands we always wanted to, under Go-To Gifting. The Bounty Basket Co. is the first.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "background": "#f6f1eb",
            "background_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#000000",
            "text_gradient": "",
            "button_background": "",
            "button_text_color": ""
          }
        }
