    "images_with_text_scrolling_G6rHke": {
      "type": "images-with-text-scrolling",
      "blocks": {
        "item_UCrLXf": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Bucket_of_Beer-1.webp",
            "icon": "picto-gift",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "A bigger idea than one brand",
            "content": "<p>Go-To Gifting started with a simple belief: great gifts shouldn’t be for one kind of person. We wanted to build a family of brands, each one nailing a different recipient, occasion, and style. The plan was always more than one basket.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_WwkQQF": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/the-bros-at-via-alondra-brobasket-warehouse.jpg",
            "icon": "picto-award-gift",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "BroBasket came first - and took off",
            "content": "<p>Our first brand, The BroBasket, answered a question everyone seemed to be asking: if women get flowers, what do the guys get? Tens of thousands of happy customers later, the answer was clearly “a BroBasket.” It grew faster than we ever expected.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_tTYdgh": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_29_2026_02_38_06_PM.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "So busy we couldn’t build the rest",
            "content": "<p>Running a fast-growing business is all-consuming. The other brands we’d dreamed up in that classroom — the ones for everyone BroBasket wasn’t built for — kept getting pushed to “someday.” For years, someday never came.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_HgwF4b": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/75f2b581-c128-4d49-b0d1-63c4d9313208.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "The question we kept getting",
            "content": "<p>Through all of it, one question landed in our inbox thousands of times: “If men get a BroBasket, what do women get?” We never had a good answer. We knew we owed people one.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_FbWHzK": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/James-bounty-basket-co.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "The answer is a Bounty Basket",
            "content": "<p>With James now at the helm and Go-To Gifting back to its original mission, we finally built it. The Bounty Basket Co. is the answer — same hand-built quality, same in-house care, now crafted for everyone worth celebrating.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
